# mutmut 3.x copies the whole working tree (source, tests, and everything in
# [tool.mutmut] also_copy) into ./mutants/ on every `mutmut run` / `nox -s mutate`.
# It is a large regenerable build artifact, and leaving it untracked-but-visible
# invites a stray `git add .` in a repo that already runs concurrent sessions.
mutants/

