# Environments
# Ignore every .env variant at any depth (may hold real secrets: prod/staging
# DB URLs, Supabase keys, LLM provider tokens); keep committed *.example
# templates. This single pattern covers .env, .env.local, .env.production,
# .env.staging, .env.e2e-prod, and any future variant so a new secret file can
# never be accidentally staged.
.env*
!.env*.example
# Docker/Portainer stack env file: may hold real OLLAMA_AUTH / secrets, never commit
stack.env
.venv
env/
venv/
ENV/
env.bak/
venv.bak/

